    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Incomplete rakah 1 of a three-rakah unit</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Defined class (inferred by a reasoner): rakah number 1 of a three-rakah Salah unit that matches one of the observed incomplete patterns (a skipped, repeated or missing posture, or a rakah that stopped early). See the rule catalog.</rdfs:comment>
